Python:
def xuLi(A):
    n = len(A)
    kiemTra = False
    for i in range(1, n):
        if A[i - 1] <= A[i]:
            kiemTra = True
    return kiemTra

C++:
bool xuLi(int A[], int n) {
    bool kiemTra = false;
    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++)
